  "verification": "Complete live Ghidra pseudocode compared with typed native implementations. Reuses mapped 0x004CC020 metrics and 0x004CC770 renderer. Old mixed Unit01622 only calls Original wrappers; no complete reusable owner found.",
  "fixes": [
    "0x004CD120 stops at dollar after a glyph, preserves the shared consumed-byte count and calls native character metrics including current-glyph writes.",
    "0x004CD010 permits 99 rendered lines, resets hash mode/current width/duplicate-space state, uses persistent 200-byte buffer, updates maximum width and accumulated y advance after every line.",
    "Catalog wrapper 0x004CCFD0 and campaign renderer 0x0041BE10 now call the full native renderer rather than startup convenience text."
  ],
  "limits": [
